XIV. 🔬 TRIAS

TRIAS validates:

identity proof
lineage proof
Watermark validity
recognition authority
recognition scope
temporal validity
evidence integrity
signature integrity
sovereignty boundaries

TRIAS must explicitly reject:

recognition → authority

when no constitutional delegation exists.


