XV. 🗣️ THE AMBASSADORS

The Ambassadors become the human/diplomatic interface between independently governed Citadels:

CITADEL A
   ↓
AMBASSADORS
   ↓
DIPLOMATIC EXCHANGE
   ↓
CITADEL B

Their functions include:

identity presentation;

constitutional translation;

dispute communication;

negotiated interoperability;

reconciliation;

preservation of diplomatic memory.


But:

THE AMBASSADOR DOES NOT BECOME THE CONSTITUTION.

Nor can diplomatic recognition bypass proof.


