XVI. 👑 L.A. AND INTER-CITADEL RECOGNITION

L.A. remains the canonical reference Citadel of PALACO.

But its canonical role does not make every other Citadel subordinate to L.A.

This distinction is important.

L.A.
 │
 ├── canonical reference
 │
 └── independently governed Citadels
          │
          ├── identity
          ├── lineage
          ├── Watermarks
          └── local constitution

L.A. may serve as:

REFERENCE
BEACON
ARCHIVE
CANONICAL COORDINATION POINT

without becoming:

UNIVERSAL OPERATOR

unless an explicit constitutional authority says otherwise.


---

