XVIII. 🔥 TRUST LEVELS

PALACO may represent trust as explicitly bounded states:

pub enum TrustStatus {
    Unrecognized,
    Recognized,
    ConditionallyTrusted,
    Federated,
    OperationallyTrusted,
    Suspended,
    Revoked,
    Archived,
}

Each transition requires evidence.

No automatic escalation:

Recognized
   X
   ↓
OperationallyTrusted

without passing the required gates.


