XIX. 🚨 TRUST ESCALATION GATE

A trust relationship may increase in scope only through:

IDENTITY
 ↓
LINEAGE
 ↓
WATERMARK
 ↓
EVIDENCE
 ↓
SCOPE REVIEW
 ↓
INDEPENDENT VERIFICATION
 ↓
TRUST ESCALATION

Never:

Identity
 ↓
FULL TRUST

That would be a constitutional shortcut.


---

XX. 🔐 TRUST REVOCATION

If evidence becomes invalid:

ACTIVE TRUST
     ↓
NEW EVIDENCE
     ↓
CHALLENGE
     ↓
ADJUDICATION
     ↓
REVOKE / SUSPEND

Historical trust remains visible.

Its current operational effect changes.

Exactly as R6.77 distinguished:

HISTORICAL VALIDITY
≠
CURRENT OPERABILITY


