XXIII. 💀 SOVEREIGNTY VIOLATION

R6.80 defines:

UNAUTHORIZED_INTER_CITADEL_AUTHORITY

when one Citadel attempts to exercise authority over another without explicit constitutional basis.

Examples:

UNAUTHORIZED_COMMAND
UNAUTHORIZED_MUTATION
UNAUTHORIZED_POLICY_OVERRIDE
UNAUTHORIZED_IDENTITY_REWRITE
UNAUTHORIZED_WATERMARK_REASSIGNMENT
UNAUTHORIZED_LINEAGE_CLAIM

The recognition relationship cannot be used as an implicit authorization channel.


