☄️ THE NEXT BOUNDARY

R6.80 established:

> Recognition does not create authority.



R6.81 introduces the mechanism by which independent constitutional entities can negotiate a relationship without surrendering sovereignty.

The central principle:

🗣️ **DIPLOMACY MAY NEGOTIATE THE RELATIONSHIP.

PROOF MUST VALIDATE THE RESULT.**

The Ambassador therefore becomes a formal constitutional actor.

Not a ruler.

Not an adjudicator.

Not a hidden authority channel.

But a mandated diplomatic representative.


