IX. 🚫 NO IMPLIED CONSENT

Silence does not create constitutional consent.

Neither does:

network connection
message receipt
API call
temporary cooperation
shared data
technical compatibility
historical friendship

The canonical rule:

CONSENT MUST BE EXPLICIT, SCOPED, AND PROVABLE.


