XII. 🦆 FOOL — THE DIPLOMATIC CHALLENGER

FOOL becomes the constitutional challenger of diplomatic claims.

Possible challenges:

INVALID_MANDATE
MANDATE_EXPIRED
SCOPE_OVERREACH
FALSE_REPRESENTATION
UNAUTHORIZED_COMMITMENT
MISSING_EVIDENCE
INVALID_RATIFICATION
CONSTITUTIONAL_CONFLICT
HIDDEN_OBLIGATION
SOVEREIGNTY_VIOLATION
FABRICATED_ACCORD

FOOL may ask:

