A
       / \
      /   \
     B─────C

The Accord must explicitly identify:

parties
individual obligations
shared obligations
conditional obligations
authority boundaries
withdrawal rules
dispute mechanisms
evidence requirements

A multi-party Accord must not become an ambiguous collective authority.


