XXV. 💎 THE ATLANTIS CLAUSE

Canonical clause:

ARTICLE XIII — THE ATLANTIS CLAUSE

> No party to the Verdrag van Atlantis may erase, falsify, or retroactively alter the historical record of its commitments, obligations, evidence, breaches, corrections, or withdrawal.



The consequence:

ACCORD MAY END.
OBLIGATION MAY END.
TRUST MAY END.
