No breach claim SHALL become constitutional fact without evidence.

VVA-I38
No remediation SHALL erase the underlying breach.

VVA-I39
No withdrawal SHALL erase prior participation.

VVA-I40
The V.V.A. SHALL preserve the distinction between promise, performance, proof, and history.


