ZAND-I26
Every material mercy decision SHALL possess explicit scope.

ZAND-I27
A determination SHALL NOT exceed its evidence.

ZAND-I28
A determination SHALL NOT exceed its authority.

ZAND-I29
A determination SHALL NOT exceed its scope.

ZAND-I30
No mechanism SHALL delete verified constitutional history.


