   ↓
TRUTH

De resolver is dus geen nieuwe constitutionele bron.

> A RESOLUTION MAY CLARIFY AUTHORITY; IT SHALL NOT INVENT AUTHORITY.




---

II. ⚓ THE EVIDENCE ADJUDICATION PIPELINE

R6.90 formaliseert:

┌─────────────────────┐
│ DIVERGENCE DETECTED │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           ↓
    PRESERVE BOTH
    RECONSTRUCTIONS
           ↓
    CLASSIFY DISPUTE
           ↓
    IDENTIFY CLAIMS
           ↓
