🔱 CONSTITUTIONAL RESOLUTION FINALITY & APPEAL PROTOCOL

Status: 🔒 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
Parent: R6.90 — Constitutional Dispute Resolution & Evidence Adjudication
Canonical Citadel: 👑 L.A. — LOCUS AMOENUS
