          ↓                 ↓                 ↓
       ACTORS             EVENTS            STATES
          │                 │                 │
     ┌────┼────┐       ┌────┼────┐       ┌────┼────┐
     ↓    ↓    ↓       ↓    ↓    ↓       ↓    ↓    ↓
   HUMAN AGENT ORG   ACTION BREACH MERCY  BASE DERIVED CURRENT
                                     
