R6.104-I16
Renaming SHALL remain distinguishable from constitutional state transition.

R6.104-I17
Deprecated names SHALL remain historically discoverable where required.

R6.104-I18
Name collisions SHALL NOT be silently resolved through assumption.

R6.104-I19
A natural-language phrase SHALL NOT acquire constitutional authority merely through repetition.

R6.104-I20
No nomenclature mechanism SHALL delete verified constitutional provenance.


