DO NOT ASSUME.

DO NOT CONFUSE THE NAME WITH THE THING.

DO NOT CONFUSE THE CLASS WITH THE TRUTH.

DO NOT CONFUSE THE DESCRIPTION WITH AUTHORITY.

DO NOT ERASE THE SPECIMEN BECAUSE THE LABEL CHANGED.

