SPECIMEN
SEED

maar ook:

RELATION

Dus:

A
│
├── DEPENDS_ON → B
├── REFERENCES → C
├── CONSTRAINED_BY → D
└── COOPERATES_WITH → E

Elke material relation krijgt provenance.


