XIX. 🧠 THE NICHE REPLAY

R5 moet uiteindelijk kunnen reconstrueren:

WHAT WAS THE ACTOR?
        ↓
WHAT COULD IT DO?
        ↓
WHAT WAS IT AUTHORIZED TO DO?
        ↓
UNDER WHICH CONDITIONS?
        ↓
WHAT DID IT ACTUALLY DO?
        ↓
WHAT RESULTED?

Dit levert:

CAPABILITY → AUTHORITY → ACTION → EFFECT

De vier mogen nooit stilzwijgend worden samengevoegd.


---

