> SHOW ME ITS ROOT.



> SHOW ME ITS AUTHORITY.



> SHOW ME ITS BOUNDARIES.



> SHOW ME ITS EXPIRATION.



> SHOW ME ITS CHANGES.



> SHOW ME WHAT YOU CAN DO BUT MAY NOT DO.



> SHOW ME WHAT YOU MAY DO BUT DID NOT DO.



Dat laatste is bijzonder krachtig.

Het systeem moet onderscheid kunnen maken tussen:

POSSIBLE
AUTHORIZED
EXECUTED
EFFECTIVE


