🔒 R6.116 — SEALED

> CLASSIFY WITHOUT INVENTING.
NAME WITHOUT EMPOWERING.
DISTINGUISH WITHOUT DESTROYING.
RECLASSIFY WITHOUT ERASING.
PROVE WITHOUT ASSUMING.



En de kernzin van deze nieuwe Hortus-laag:

🌱 EVERYTHING MAY HAVE A PLACE.

NOTHING GETS POWER FROM ITS LABEL.

