       ↓
ISOLATION
       ↓
SCOPE DETERMINATION
       ↓
IMPACT ANALYSIS
       ↓
REMEDIATION
       ↓
RESTORATION

This connects directly to the Citadel's Zero Trust architecture.

The ecosystem protects itself by controlling edges, not merely nodes.


