XIX. 🌊 RECOVERY

After disruption:

STATE₀
 ↓
DISTURBANCE
 ↓
STATE₁
 ↓
REMEDIATION
 ↓
STATE₂

STATE₂ may resemble STATE₀.

But:

STATE₂ ≠ STATE₀

unless proven identical.

Restoration is therefore another state transition.

It is never a magical return that deletes the intervening history.


---

XX. 🌳 ECOLOGICAL MEMORY

This produces:

