     ↓
WHAT CHANGED
     ↓
WHAT CAUSED THE CHANGE
     ↓
WHAT WAS REPAIRED
     ↓
WHAT REMAINS DIFFERENT
     ↓
WHAT EXISTS NOW

That is the constitutional equivalent of ecological memory.


