🔐 R6 HARDENING RULE

De R6-arc levert daarmee een formele engineeringtest:

CAN I TRACE IT?
        │
        ├── NO → UNPROVEN
        │
        └── YES
             ↓
        CAN I PROVE IT?
             │
             ├── NO → UNPROVEN
             │
             └── YES
                  ↓
             IS AUTHORITY VALID?
                  │
                  ├── NO → UNAUTHORIZED
                  │
                  └── YES
                       ↓
                    ACCEPT

Dit is de operationalisering van:

DO NOT ADD WHAT THE EVIDENCE DOES NOT CONTAIN.


