⚖️ VIII. TRIAS DETERMINATION RECORD

De determinatie krijgt een formele record:

pub struct HortusDetermination {
    pub determination_id: DeterminationId,
    pub specimen: SpecimenId,
    pub candidate: CandidateId,
    pub evidence_root: EvidenceRoot,
    pub authority: AuthorityReference,
    pub scope: Scope,
    pub epistemic_status: EpistemicStatus,
    pub watermark: WatermarkId,
}

Met bijvoorbeeld:

pub enum EpistemicStatus {
    Unknown,
    Observed,
    Candidate,
    Supported,
    Verified,
    Uncertain,
    Disputed,
    Unproven,
}

Dit is de epistemische ruggengraat van DEMO.


