Herbarium wordt de historische, inspecteerbare laag van de Hortus.

De levende tuin toont het heden.

Het Herbarium bewaart het verleden.


---

🔒 XIII. NEW CANONICAL INVARIANTS

HORTUS-I01

Every material classification SHALL have an explicit determination path.

HORTUS-I02

Every determination path SHALL identify its distinguishing evidence.

HORTUS-I03

Candidate generation SHALL remain distinct from constitutional determination.

HORTUS-I04

Alternative candidates SHALL remain inspectable where materially relevant.

HORTUS-I05

Unknown SHALL NOT silently become verified.

HORTUS-I06

A changed determination SHALL create a successor state.

HORTUS-I07

Previous determinations SHALL remain historically traceable.

HORTUS-I08

Every material determination SHALL be replayable.

HORTUS-I09

FOOL SHALL be able to inspect the rejected alternatives.

HORTUS-I10

No classification SHALL exceed its evidence.


