PRECEDENT
≠
AUTOMATIC AUTHORITY

BRAINPOWER may discover precedent.

FOOL may challenge its applicability.

TRIAS determines whether the constitutional framework recognizes it.

Thus:

HISTORY
→ EVIDENCE

not automatically:

HISTORY
→ AUTHORITY


